[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210872914","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101894#issuecomment-3210872914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101894","id":3210872914,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_YghS","user":{"login":"jitdev87","id":355434,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTQzNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/355434?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitdev87","html_url":"https://github.com/jitdev87","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitdev87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitdev87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitdev87/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitdev87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitdev87/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitdev87/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitdev87/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitdev87/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitdev87/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T14:35:26Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T19:57:42Z","body":"Same issue happening to me, the game freezes and the console gets flooded with:\n\n`ERROR: Condition \"p_elem->_root != this\" is true.\n   at: remove (./core/templates/self_list.h:80)`\n\nThis happens even with the Physics 2D setting \"Run on Separate Thread\" disabled.\nGodot version: 4.4.1.stable\n\nEDIT: I'm using 2D physics\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210872914/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218455728","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101894#issuecomment-3218455728","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101894","id":3218455728,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_1byw","user":{"login":"Khusheete","id":48362835,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MzYyODM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48362835?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khusheete","html_url":"https://github.com/Khusheete","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khusheete/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khusheete/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khusheete/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khusheete/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khusheete/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khusheete/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khusheete/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khusheete/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khusheete/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-24T23:39:47Z","updated_at":"2025-08-24T23:39:47Z","body":"> This happens even with the Physics 2D setting \"Run on Separate Thread\" disabled. Godot version: 4.4.1.stable\n\nAre you using threads in other ways that may call physics-related functions ? If not, it _might_ be another similar issue somewhere else in the engine, as it seems very likely (to me) that this kind of crash is due to race conditions.\n\nCould you test with the MRP to check you get a crash both with and without the `Run on Separate Thread` option enabled ?\nTesting it on `4.4.1.stable` myself, there is a crash only when it is enabled. But that could very well be a \"it works on my machine\" kind of issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218455728/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5087441663","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101894#issuecomment-5087441663","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101894","id":5087441663,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLzwy_w","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T05:00:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T05:00:49Z","body":"I can't reproduce this with your 2D or 3D MRP. Not sure if I am missing something? I checked in settings and 'Run in seperate thread' was enabled already in your MRP.\n\nI am running 4.7.1-stable\n\nI have tried on my laptop, MacOS arm64 M5, Tahoe 26.5.2, and my PC, Ryzen 9800, Windows 11","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5087441663/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0